1-c9d2d884d224","qty":1,"type":"labor","reserved":false,"subtotal":1500,"unitPrice":1500,"description":"Service"}],"total":10500,"sentDate":"2026-06-04","subtotal":10500,"validUntil":"2026-06-11","approvedDate":"2026-06-05","approvedBy":"customer"},"total":10500,"status":"ready","qcItems":[],"priority":"normal","createdBy":"mosesndungumuthee","diagnosis":{"findings":"Upon inspection, we observed signs of liquid damage on the motherboard, particularly around the charging ports, power button area, keyboard connector, heatsink section, and display cable connection.\\n\\nAs a result of the liquid exposure, the charging ports and keyboard are currently non-functional.\\n\\nWe can attempt to clean the motherboard and carry out the necessary repairs. There is a possibility that the charging port issue can be resolved through the cleaning and repair process. However, liquid damage is best addressed immediately after the incident, and delayed intervention increases the risk of corrosion and damage to other components.\\n\\nDue to the extent and nature of the liquid damage, the outcome of the repair is difficult to predict. At this stage, we would estimate the chances of a successful repair at approximately 50/50. While the device may function properly after the repair, there is also a possibility that additional issues could develop either during testing or over time as a result of the existing liquid damage.\\n\\nFor this reason, we cannot guarantee a full or permanent recovery of the device, although we will make every effort to restore its functionality.\\n","diagnosedBy":"Duncan Kiptoo Bett","diagnosedDate":"2026-06-04","estimatedHours":40,"faultDescription":"Keyboard and charging ports faulty","recommendedAction":"Motherboard repair and keyboard replacement "},"laborCost":10500,"partsUsed":[],"productId":"","slaMissed":false,"customerId":"d1a7f089-7bc7-4f8b-b691-dd9d4d747fb2","intakeDate":"2026-06-04","repairPath":"diagnosis_first","accessories":[{"name":"NONE","receive